*.log
# *.dmg and *.zip were excluded here — removed. Stray local test DMGs
# already can't reach a deploy via the Desktop/ rule above, and this
# blanket rule was also silently dropping public/downloads/ATLAS.dmg
# (the one real production asset) from every deployment regardless of
# git tracking, which is why that download 404'd in production despite
# being correctly committed and pushed. A "!public/downloads/ATLAS.dmg"
# negation here did not override it — Vercel's ignore-file parser
# apparently doesn't support git-style negation, so removing the rule
# outright was the actual fix.

# Mac noise
.DS_Store
Library/Saved Application State/
